// Short video clips (WebM: VP9 video, Opus audio) for the demo network, so the Videos and
// Shorts pages have something to play without a network. Each is a few seconds of an
// animated colour field with a soft chord, made with ffmpeg, for example:
//   ffmpeg -f lavfi -i "nullsrc=s=180x320:r=24:d=6,geq=r='128+100*sin(X/14+T*2.1)':g='60+50*sin(Y/18-T*1.4)':b='170+80*sin((X+Y)/22+T*1.1)',scale=360:640" \
//     -f lavfi -i "aevalsrc='0.1*sin(2*PI*220*t)':s=48000:d=6" -c:v libvpx-vp9 -b:v 0 -crf 47 -c:a libopus -b:a 20k -shortest neon.webm
